{"sections":[],"kind":"article","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/HNSWVectorSearch","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Scale approximate nearest neighbor (ANN) retrieval using Hierarchical Navigable Small World graphs with empirical logarithmic query scaling under navigable graph structure."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Guides & Tutorials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/DimensionalityReduction","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/ClusteringAndOutliers","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorStoreAndRAG"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Guides--Tutorials"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster"]]},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Overview","anchor":"Overview"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"When vector collections expand beyond tens of thousands of items, exact (O(N \\cdot d)) linear scans become a major latency bottleneck for real-time recommendation and retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) systems."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HNSWIndex"},{"type":"text","text":" actor provides a hierarchical graph-based spatial partitioning index with low query latency and empirical (O(\\log N \\cdot M \\cdot d)) search scaling on well-behaved distributions of bounded intrinsic dimensionality (with recall\/work traded explicitly via "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"M"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"efConstruction"},{"type":"text","text":", and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"efSearch"},{"type":"text","text":", rather than a worst-case logarithmic bound in arbitrary dimensions)."}]},{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Hierarchical Navigable Small World Architecture","anchor":"Hierarchical-Navigable-Small-World-Architecture"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"HNSW constructs a hierarchy of graph layers:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Top Layers (Sparse)"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":": Contain widely spaced long-range highway edges for rapid coarse geometric routing across distant clusters."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Intermediate Layers"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Progressively decrease edge length while increasing vertex density."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Bottom Layer (Layer 0, Dense)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": Contains all indexed vertices connected by dense short-range edges for high-accuracy localized nearest-neighbor refinement."}]}]}]},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["Layer 2 (Express):   [A] ───────────────────────────► [F]","                      │                                │","                      ▼                                ▼","Layer 1 (Regional):  [A] ──────────► [C] ────────────► [F]","                      │               │                │","                      ▼               ▼                ▼","Layer 0 (Base):      [A] ──► [B] ──► [C] ──► [D] ──► [E] ──► [F]"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Key-Configuration-Parameters","level":2,"text":"Key Configuration Parameters"},{"header":"row","type":"table","alignments":["left","left","left"],"rows":[[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Parameter"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Recommended Default"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Impact on Search Quality & Index Build Time"}]}]],[[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"M"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"16"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Maximum outgoing connections per node. Higher values improve recall at the cost of higher memory and index construction time."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"efConstruction"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"200"}],"type":"paragraph"}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Size of dynamic candidate evaluation queue during insertion. Larger values produce higher-quality graph connectivity."}]}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"efSearch"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"50"}]}],[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dynamic queue size during search traversal. Higher values increase search recall towards 100% exact match."}],"type":"paragraph"}]],[[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"metric"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".euclideanDistance"}]}],[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Choice of "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".euclideanDistance"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".cosineSimilarity"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".dotProduct"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]]]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Example-Usage","level":2,"text":"Example Usage"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["import SwiftCluster","","\/\/ 1. Initialize the actor-isolated index","let hnsw = HNSWIndex(metric: .cosineSimilarity, M: 16, efConstruction: 200, efSearch: 50)","","\/\/ 2. Add embeddings asynchronously","await hnsw.add(id: \"doc_news_1\", vector: [0.12, 0.94, -0.31], metadata: [\"category\": \"news\"])","await hnsw.add(id: \"doc_tech_2\", vector: [-0.85, 0.11, 0.52], metadata: [\"category\": \"technology\"])","","\/\/ 3. Query Top-K nearest neighbors","let queryEmbedding = [0.10, 0.90, -0.30]","let matches = await hnsw.search(query: queryEmbedding, topK: 5)","","for match in matches {","    print(\"Matched: \\(match.id) with score: \\(match.score)\")","}"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Thread-Safety--Swift-6-Strict-Concurrency","level":2,"text":"Thread Safety & Swift 6 Strict Concurrency"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"HNSWIndex"},{"type":"text","text":" is implemented as an isolated Swift "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"actor"},{"type":"text","text":", guaranteeing thread safety and eliminating race conditions when multiple background tasks insert items or execute queries concurrently."}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/hnswvectorsearch"]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Spatial Indexing","anchor":"Spatial-Indexing","identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/HNSWIndex","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorMetric","doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorSearchResult"]}],"metadata":{"title":"High-Dimensional Vector Search with HNSW","role":"collectionGroup","modules":[{"name":"SwiftCluster"}],"roleHeading":"API Collection"},"references":{"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster/VectorStore":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"VectorStore","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An in-memory vector database and similarity search index optimized for Apple Silicon."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swiftcluster\/vectorstore","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster\/VectorStore","type":"topic","title":"VectorStore","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"VectorStore","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://SwiftCluster/documentation/SwiftCluster":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiftCluster\/documentation\/SwiftCluster","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"PCA Dimensionality Reduction & Unsupervised Clust